WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.518 --> 00:00:02.697
- Reindeers are real.

00:00:02.697 --> 00:00:04.197
Christmas is real.

00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:09.547
I swear to God if I can not
pass at least one challenge

00:00:09.547 --> 00:00:11.747
this time, I just can't do anything right.

00:00:11.747 --> 00:00:14.621
- I love Christmas, but I'm also an adult.

00:00:14.621 --> 00:00:17.020
So I don't think I'll have
any trouble not smiling.

00:00:17.020 --> 00:00:19.937
Also, my competition is Clark so --

00:00:20.773 --> 00:00:23.781
- I will not smile because
I've been a bad boy.

00:00:23.781 --> 00:00:24.980
(laughs)

00:00:24.980 --> 00:00:29.064
- Things that would make me
smile paying my cell phone bill.

00:00:29.064 --> 00:00:30.331
Paying my rent.

00:00:30.331 --> 00:00:32.051
- Christmas sucks.

00:00:32.051 --> 00:00:32.884
Let's go.

00:00:34.181 --> 00:00:35.341
See the title is moving already.

00:00:35.341 --> 00:00:37.112
I know I'm not gonna do good.

00:00:37.112 --> 00:00:38.363
- Why are you smiling like that?

00:00:38.363 --> 00:00:39.253
- I just like to smile.

00:00:39.253 --> 00:00:40.086
Smiling's my favorite.

00:00:40.086 --> 00:00:42.027
- This is actually my
favorite Christmas movie.

00:00:42.027 --> 00:00:42.860
- Okay, people.

00:00:42.860 --> 00:00:45.061
Tomorrow morning 10 a.m.

00:00:45.061 --> 00:00:46.293
Santa's coming to town.

00:00:46.293 --> 00:00:47.830
- Santa!

00:00:47.830 --> 00:00:49.403
Oh my God!

00:00:49.403 --> 00:00:51.333
(laughs)

00:00:51.333 --> 00:00:52.261
I know him.

00:00:52.261 --> 00:00:53.923
- This would make anybody smile though.

00:00:53.923 --> 00:00:54.904
This is not fair.

00:00:54.904 --> 00:00:56.252
- Boom, I did it.

00:00:56.252 --> 00:00:57.643
I completed the first challenge.

00:00:57.643 --> 00:00:59.293
This is my time.

00:00:59.293 --> 00:01:00.893
- Got out all my little giggles.

00:01:00.893 --> 00:01:04.060
I'm about to you know straight G-mode.

00:01:07.824 --> 00:01:09.344
- [Man] You can't smile.

00:01:09.344 --> 00:01:10.177
- Oh crap.

00:01:10.177 --> 00:01:11.671
- Would you like to sit on Santa's lap?

00:01:11.671 --> 00:01:12.504
- Okay.

00:01:12.504 --> 00:01:13.337
Am I allowed?

00:01:13.337 --> 00:01:14.744
- It's surprisingly
really hard not to smile

00:01:14.744 --> 00:01:16.304
when you're looking at Santa Clause.

00:01:16.304 --> 00:01:17.137
- How are you today?

00:01:17.137 --> 00:01:17.970
- I'm good.

00:01:17.970 --> 00:01:18.803
How are you?

00:01:18.803 --> 00:01:20.807
- Mrs Clause had some,
some medical work done

00:01:20.807 --> 00:01:23.127
so she can't really stand that well.

00:01:23.127 --> 00:01:24.658
You can take my job.

00:01:24.658 --> 00:01:25.491
- Santa (laughs).

00:01:25.491 --> 00:01:26.896
(Santa mumbles)

00:01:26.896 --> 00:01:27.847
- How about that?

00:01:27.847 --> 00:01:29.527
This is the secret to marriage.

00:01:29.527 --> 00:01:30.360
- Okay.

00:01:30.360 --> 00:01:31.577
- Say yes and do what you want.

00:01:31.577 --> 00:01:34.095
- How does that work out for you?

00:01:34.095 --> 00:01:35.349
- She finally caught on.

00:01:35.349 --> 00:01:37.228
So now Santa has a new routine,

00:01:37.228 --> 00:01:39.988
and he says he's working on it.

00:01:39.988 --> 00:01:40.821
- Okay.

00:01:40.821 --> 00:01:42.199
- Would you like to sit on Santa's lap?

00:01:42.199 --> 00:01:43.127
- Yeah sure.

00:01:43.127 --> 00:01:45.319
- Okay, don't put all your weight down.

00:01:45.319 --> 00:01:46.152
(laughs)

00:01:46.152 --> 00:01:49.277
- Santa is an internet troll, an IRL.

00:01:49.277 --> 00:01:51.360
(laughs)

00:01:52.639 --> 00:01:54.949
- Santa is like really chatty.

00:01:54.949 --> 00:01:57.358
- I smiled because it's just
like really awkward and creepy.

00:01:57.358 --> 00:01:58.525
This is weird.

00:01:59.378 --> 00:02:03.909
- This better not be no Buzz
Feed animals kicking bullshit.

00:02:03.909 --> 00:02:05.616
- I don't know why we
sign up for this stuff.

00:02:05.616 --> 00:02:10.189
- [Man] There might be like
an animal surprise there.

00:02:10.189 --> 00:02:11.022
- I don't do animals.

00:02:11.022 --> 00:02:12.548
I do humans.

00:02:12.548 --> 00:02:14.616
- [Man] But then you lose the challenge.

00:02:14.616 --> 00:02:17.479
- Okay, I'm thinking not happy thoughts.

00:02:17.479 --> 00:02:18.607
I'm not gonna smile.

00:02:18.607 --> 00:02:20.038
I am in a cage.

00:02:20.038 --> 00:02:20.955
Oh my gosh.

00:02:27.778 --> 00:02:30.195
Those are real live reindeer.

00:02:31.629 --> 00:02:33.607
I didn't know that reindeer were real.

00:02:33.607 --> 00:02:35.190
Do they have names?

00:02:38.026 --> 00:02:40.247
A reindeer in Brooklyn.

00:02:40.247 --> 00:02:41.080
What?

00:02:41.080 --> 00:02:43.163
(laughs)

00:02:44.389 --> 00:02:48.079
Did you just see its
half holly jolly shimmy?

00:02:48.079 --> 00:02:49.627
Hi, Prancer.

00:02:49.627 --> 00:02:51.710
(laughs)

00:02:54.047 --> 00:02:56.479
They have majestic little shimmies.

00:02:56.479 --> 00:02:59.098
Okay, I'm gonna say I've
failed this challenge

00:02:59.098 --> 00:03:02.850
'cause I just want to like
revel in this beautiful moment.

00:03:02.850 --> 00:03:05.309
(laughs)

00:03:05.309 --> 00:03:07.218
It's a Christmas miracle.

00:03:07.218 --> 00:03:09.088
It's the most wonderful time of the year.

00:03:09.088 --> 00:03:11.799
Th spirit of Christmas
is alive in Brooklyn.

00:03:11.799 --> 00:03:12.949
Happy Holidays.

00:03:12.949 --> 00:03:13.888
Remember to smile.

00:03:13.888 --> 00:03:15.399
Thank your parents.

00:03:15.399 --> 00:03:16.439
(laughs)

00:03:16.439 --> 00:03:20.606
And dance and prance and
jingle on your merry way.

00:03:22.736 --> 00:03:24.709
Hi, you wanna dance with me?

00:03:24.709 --> 00:03:26.361
Yeah, you want to do a little shimmy?

